# --- orders-api BFF (server-only -- never NEXT_PUBLIC_*, never sent to the browser) ---
# Internal-only orders-api listener. Matches orders-api's own HOST/PORT.
ORDERS_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4000
# Must match orders-api's INTERNAL_API_KEY exactly (see apps/orders-api/.env.example).
INTERNAL_API_KEY=dev-internal-key-change-me
# Signs the session cookie (see src/lib/session.ts). Generate a real random value per
# environment; this is a dev-only placeholder. Unique to this app -- never share it with
# staff-console's SESSION_SECRET.
SESSION_SECRET=dev-storefront-session-secret-change-me
